  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Bahamas Education Sector Transformation Project: Phase I</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The BEST Project will finance the construction of modern, climate-resilient school facilities to meet current and future needs in East Grand Bahama. Specifically, the Project will support the retrofitting of the High Rock Primary School to accommodate pre-primary, primary and junior secondary students during the construction phase of the new East Grand Bahama Comprehensive School. The Project will also include the  digital transformation of the Ministry of Education to enhance operational effectiveness and service delivery.</narrative>
  </description>
